                            Employer Branding</h3>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 max-w-2xl">A careers
                            story that matches the company people actually join, because your best candidates research
                            you the same way your customers do. Includes: employer value proposition, careers page
                            content, leadership visibility for hiring, employee advocacy.</p>
                    </a>
